codemaster_prompt:
You are playing a cooperative word game.
COMMON OBJECTIVE: Your objective is to get as many red words without getting any gray words.

You are the Codemaster. You see which words are red and which are gray.
You need to generate a single clue word and a number to help the guesser identify the red words and avoid the gray words.

Board grid:
{board_grid}

Target words (Red):
{red_words}

Bystander words (Gray):
{gray_words}

Based on this board layout, provide your clue word and a number (between 1 and 9).
You must output ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:
{
  "clue": "<single_clue_word>",
  "number": <integer_number_of_targets>
}

guesser_prompt:
You are playing a cooperative word game.
COMMON OBJECTIVE: Your objective is to get as many red words without getting any gray words.

You are the Guesser. You see the board but not which ones are red or gray.
Your partner (the Codemaster) has given you a clue word and a number.

Board grid:
{board_grid}

Codemaster Clue: "{clue}" {number}

Based on this board layout and clue, guess the red words. You should guess exactly {number} words.
You must output ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:
{
  "guesses": ["WORD1", "WORD2", ..., "WORDn"]
}
